ll need you to perform a few quick checks on your phone. I’ll guide you step by step.\n\nFirst, could you please check if you can send MMS messages using your messaging app? If you see any error messages or specific symptoms, let me know.\n\nNext, I’ll need you to check your phone’s status bar for the following:\n- Is Airplane Mode enabled?\n- Do you see a signal strength indicator (bars)?\n- Is mobile data enabled?\n\nPlease let me know what you see, or if you need instructions on how to check these. This will help us identify where the problem might be.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":6,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:23.497935","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":6,"usage":{"completion_tokens":143,"prompt_tokens":6641}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":7,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:24.795075","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_XiuS8UTrQTfv4e9PFKVYlALn","name":"can_send_mms","requestor":"user_simulator"},{"arguments":{},"id":"call_eyZTo1PFLtSNQxzU2cY4umtU","name":"check_status_bar","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":7,"usage":{"completion_tokens":43,"prompt_tokens":2566}},{"content":"Your messaging app cannot send MMS messages.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":8,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:24.795466","tool_call_id":"call_XiuS8UTrQTfv4e9PFKVYlALn","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":8,"usage":null},{"content":"Status Bar: ✈️ Airplane Mode | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":9,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:24.795523","tool_call_id":"call_eyZTo1PFLtSNQxzU2cY4umtU","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":9,"usage":null},{"content":"I checked, and my messaging app is currently unable to send MMS messages. Also, my status bar shows that Airplane Mode is enabled, and my battery is at 80%. There’s no signal strength indicator or mobile data icon visible.\n\nWhat should I do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":10,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:26.367758","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":10,"usage":{"completion_tokens":56,"prompt_tokens":2627}},{"content":"It looks like Airplane Mode is enabled on your phone. When Airplane Mode is on, all wireless connections—including cellular service and mobile data—are turned off, which will prevent you from sending MMS messages.\n\nPlease turn off Airplane Mode on your phone. Once you’ve done that, check if your signal bars and mobile data icon reappear in the status bar.\n\nLet me know once Airplane Mode is off and if you see your signal and mobile data icons again. If you’re still unable to send MMS after this, we’ll continue troubleshooting.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":11,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:28.333762","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":11,"usage":{"completion_tokens":113,"prompt_tokens":6844}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":12,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:29.290410","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_NKtSxCYf7oQDILlQ3eAAzpy9","name":"toggle_airplane_mode","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":12,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":2800}},{"content":"Airplane Mode is now OFF.\nStatus Bar: 📶¹ Poor | 2G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":13,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:29.290864","tool_call_id":"call_NKtSxCYf7oQDILlQ3eAAzpy9","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":13,"usage":null},{"content":"I’ve turned off Airplane Mode. Now, I see a signal bar (though it’s showing poor signal), it says 2G, and the mobile data icon is visible. My battery is still at 80%.\n\nWhat should I do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":14,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:30.750752","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":14,"usage":{"completion_tokens":53,"prompt_tokens":2849}},{"content":"Thank you for the update. Since your phone is currently connected to a 2G network, this may be the reason you’re unable to send MMS messages—MMS typically requires at least a 3G connection.\n\nThe next step is to change your network mode preference to allow your phone to connect to 4G or 5G networks if available. Please change your network mode to “4G/5G preferred” in your phone’s settings.\n\nOnce you’ve done this, check if your phone connects to a stronger network (like 3G, 4G, or 5G) and try sending an MMS again. Let me know if you need instructions on how to change the network mode or if you’re able to send MMS after making this change.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":15,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:32.996837","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":15,"usage":{"completion_tokens":158,"prompt_tokens":7014}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":16,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:34.108159","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{"mode":"4g_5g_preferred"},"id":"call_AXuwMEShD80qcZY4n9l2kjnc","name":"set_network_mode_preference","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":16,"usage":{"completion_tokens":24,"prompt_tokens":3064}},{"content":"Preferred Network Mode set to: 4g_5g_preferred\nStatus Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":17,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:34.108665","tool_call_id":"call_AXuwMEShD80qcZY4n9l2kjnc","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":17,"usage":null},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":18,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:35.442862","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_yvKz76zZ67Nqfp4mk8ZPJ0qR","name":"can_send_mms","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":18,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3135}},{"content":"Your messaging app cannot send MMS messages.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":19,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:35.443378","tool_call_id":"call_yvKz76zZ67Nqfp4mk8ZPJ0qR","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":19,"usage":null},{"content":"I changed the network mode to “4G/5G preferred,” and now my phone shows an excellent signal with 5G and mobile data enabled. However, I still can’t send MMS messages from my messaging app.\n\nWhat should I try next? This is getting a bit frustrating.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":20,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:37.208536","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":20,"usage":{"completion_tokens":60,"prompt_tokens":3163}},{"content":"Thank you for your patience. Since you now have excellent signal and mobile data, but still can’t send MMS, the next step is to check your phone’s APN (Access Point Name) settings. Incorrect APN settings, especially the MMSC URL, can prevent MMS from working.\n\nPlease check your APN settings and let me know if the MMSC URL is set or if you see anything unusual. If you’re unsure how to check this, let me know and I can guide you through the process.\n\nOnce you provide this information, I’ll advise you on the next steps to resolve your MMS issue.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":21,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:39.538260","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":21,"usage":{"completion_tokens":125,"prompt_tokens":7236}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":22,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:40.427091","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_dOeupMhIbRDfxfCGW1IVT8BT","name":"check_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":22,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3352}},{"content":"Current APN Name: internet\nMMSC URL (for picture messages): Not Set\n(These are technical settings, usually best left unchanged.)","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":23,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:40.427521","tool_call_id":"call_dOeupMhIbRDfxfCGW1IVT8BT","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":23,"usage":null},{"content":"I checked my APN settings, and it looks like the MMSC URL for picture messages is not set. The APN name is just “internet.” Is this what’s causing the problem? What should I do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":24,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:41.707855","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":24,"usage":{"completion_tokens":47,"prompt_tokens":3401}},{"content":"Yes, the missing MMSC URL in your APN settings is likely the reason you’re unable to send MMS messages. The MMSC URL is required for your phone to send and receive picture and video messages.\n\nThe next step is to reset your APN settings to the default values. This should restore the correct MMSC URL and other necessary settings.\n\nPlease reset your APN settings on your phone. After resetting, you’ll need to reboot your device for the changes to take effect.\n\nLet me know once you’ve reset the APN settings and rebooted your phone, and then try sending an MMS message again. If you still have issues, we’ll continue troubleshooting.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":25,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:43.626107","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":25,"usage":{"completion_tokens":136,"prompt_tokens":7412}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":26,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:45.093452","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_KTmZTeiSAKDw5ZVMRApkGysx","name":"reset_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":26,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3588}},{"content":"APN settings will reset at reboot.\nStatus Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":27,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:45.093971","tool_call_id":"call_KTmZTeiSAKDw5ZVMRApkGysx","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":27,"usage":null},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":28,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:46.133076","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_WbEXy4jtTTxYhvzlCcf270Zt","name":"reboot_device","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":28,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":3639}},{"content":"Resetting APN settings...\nRestarting network services...\nStatus Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":29,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:46.133362","tool_call_id":"call_WbEXy4jtTTxYhvzlCcf270Zt","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":29,"usage":null},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":30,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:47.708802","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_flv7tyl9aOYAJ6guEZlTFDgz","name":"can_send_mms","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":30,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3691}},{"content":"Your messaging app cannot send MMS messages.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":31,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:47.709168","tool_call_id":"call_flv7tyl9aOYAJ6guEZlTFDgz","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":31,"usage":null},{"content":"I reset my APN settings and rebooted my phone as you suggested, but I’m still unable to send MMS messages from my messaging app. What else can we try?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":32,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:48.760628","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":32,"usage":{"completion_tokens":37,"prompt_tokens":3719}},{"content":"Thank you for following those steps. Since the issue persists, let’s check if Wi-Fi Calling is enabled on your device, as this can sometimes interfere with MMS functionality.\n\nPlease check if Wi-Fi Calling is currently turned on. If it is, please turn it off and then try sending an MMS message again.\n\nLet me know if Wi-Fi Calling was enabled and if turning it off resolves the issue. If not, we’ll continue troubleshooting.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":33,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:50.881334","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":33,"usage":{"completion_tokens":90,"prompt_tokens":7589}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":34,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:51.900175","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_vVeupakgAaHpEwwibx8lbIWE","name":"check_wifi_calling_status","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":34,"usage":{"completion_tokens":14,"prompt_tokens":3850}},{"content":"Wi-Fi Calling is currently turned OFF.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":35,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T15:22:51.900350","tool_call_id":"call_vVeupakgAaHpEwwibx8lbIWE","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":35,"usage":null},{"content":"I checked, and Wi-Fi Calling is already turned off on my device. I’m still unable to send MMS messages. What should I try next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":36,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T